line = 391
class = "interface-mismatch"
severity = "high"
observed = "Run without -authority/-vault uses LoadChainConfig, and SetCaps checks the first asset's address but copies its independent asset_id into MsgSetCap. A native address of zero with a different 20-byte asset_id passes these checks. Paxeer registers that other asset while PaxeerXVault.depositNative emits zero; Keeper.BridgeIn rejects the real deposit with ErrUnknownAsset."
