proposal = "Route legacy and canonical input through the same asset-binding validation in services/bridge/deploy/proposals/proposals.go before generating any bodies. Reject mismatched EVM IDs and Solana mint handles, then prove the accepted cap against a vault-emitted deposit through the real bridge keeper."
